  "NOT_PROVED": {
    "the doubled (inner,outer,outer) pair": "21 of the 23 points on this page are Lean-checked. The two remaining are the doubled (inner,outer,outer) class of d = 5/2, r = 25/7 +- 45*sqrt(2)/28 -- still COMPUTED only: exact arithmetic, zero tangency residual, untrusted oracle. Their two external tangencies carry 115 and 128; the difference-of-squares factorisation that would tame them is derived in Coordinates.lean but not yet carried out."
